WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Meet Browser Control. A little help, right where you are.

00:05.000 --> 00:15.000
Bring page context into the conversation. Keep every browser action in view.

00:15.000 --> 00:23.000
Enable memory once. Keep useful preferences across regular chats.

00:23.000 --> 00:31.000
Describe. Demonstrate. Review. Save your way of doing things as a local skill.

00:31.000 --> 00:37.000
Choose how actions are approved. Activity, action limits, and Stop stay available.

00:37.000 --> 00:41.000
One small side panel. A more capable everyday browser.

00:41.000 --> 00:45.000
Open source. No API key. Set up the local companion, sign in, and make it yours.
